","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241117013:1":{"text":"응? 왜?","source_cn":"哎？为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CDEF774288C4747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241117014:1":{"text":"우리 아빠가 죄를 저질렀다면서 나도 잘못이 있으니 나와 놀지 않겠다고 했거든.","source_cn":"因为那些孩子说我的父亲是犯了错的人，所以我也有错，不和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748D4D199587A4B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241117015:1":{"text":"걔들이랑 같이 놀고 싶다면 내가 저지른 잘못을 만회하고 걔들을 즐겁게 해줄 방법을 찾아야 했어.","source_cn":"如果我要和他们一起玩，就要弥补犯的错，想办法让他们开心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FC4068E96E23025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241117016:1":{"text":"말도 안 되는 소리였지. 하지만 그땐 진짜라고 믿었어!","source_cn":"很荒谬，但我当时真的信了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF59A053A97C3BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1241117016":{"text":"말도 안 되는 소리였지. 하지만 그땐 진짜라고 믿었어!","source_cn":"很荒谬，但我当时真的信了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF59A053A97C3BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241117018:1":{"text":"돈을 훔친 걸 엄마에게 들켜서 반 죽을 때까지 맞긴 했