matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3052C6ED6ADB8108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1241117024:1":{"text":"...아버지와 그의 선원들이 비겁한 겁쟁이라는 말 말이야.","source_cn":"——我的父亲和他的船员们，是一群胆小的懦夫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x432105C0F874C0BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241117025:1":{"text":"지금 생각해 보면 맞을만했어.","source_cn":"现在想想，确实该打。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12F22D0F9F45DF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241117026:1":{"text":"그때의 신밧드를 만나면 나라도 본때를 보여줬을걸.","source_cn":"换我遇见了那时候的辛巴达，也会好好教训一下他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97EA1B94A8A11DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1241117027:1":{"text":"분명 나도 아버지와 선원 삼촌들에 대해 잘 알고 있으면서, 다른 사람들이 모두 그들을 의심할 때 믿어주지 못한 걸까?","source_cn":"明明我很了解老爹和船员叔叔的为人，为什么在别人都怀疑他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4173D7B5B155031C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1241117028:1":{"text":"만약 그들이 알았더라면 얼마나 속상할까...","source_cn":"如果他们知道了，该有多伤心啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC45CC5FADC66159F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"",